# oracle: kspace_style msm with shrink-wrapped boundaries s s s (the box follows the atoms at each reneighboring, here every step, and the MSM set-up is re-run, native Domain::reset_box; with fewer rebuilds atoms leave the box and native stops with Out of range atoms - cannot compute MSM), pair hybrid/overlay lj/cut + coul/msm (cutoff/adjust sets the coul/msm sub-style's cutoff), order 4, pressure/scalar no, a rocksalt cluster of 64 ions at 600 K, NVE, 60 steps.
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 3.2e-15, atoms 9.2e-14.
units           metal
atom_style      charge
boundary        s s s
lattice         fcc 5.64
region          box block 0 2 0 2 0 2
create_box      2 box
region          clus block 0 1.99 0 1.99 0 1.99
create_atoms    1 region clus
lattice         fcc 5.64 origin 0.5 0.0 0.0
create_atoms    2 region clus
mass            1 22.99
mass            2 35.45
set             type 1 charge 1.0
set             type 2 charge -1.0
velocity        all create 600.0 87287 dist gaussian
pair_style      hybrid/overlay lj/cut 7.0 coul/msm 7.0
pair_coeff      1 1 lj/cut 0.0100 2.35
pair_coeff      2 2 lj/cut 0.0050 4.40
pair_coeff      1 2 lj/cut 0.0070 3.00
pair_coeff      * * coul/msm
kspace_style    msm 1.0e-4
kspace_modify   order 4 pressure/scalar no
neighbor        1.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check no
timestep        0.002
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl ecoul elong etotal press vol
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             60
